    "head_commit_message": "feat(formation): each unit's bearing lives in the unit store\n\nSpec 35 step 3. The bearing moves off SkirmishUnit into the store's\ncolumns (UnitColumns.BEARING, by slot) on both backends at once: the\nGDScript store, and Rust's Columns on the BodyField. A new slot faces\neast, as a new unit did. Every reader and writer switched in this\nchange (Decision 142): passes over many units fetch the column once,\nthe turns and scattered reads use value and put.\n\nTests: test_unit_bearing.gd (new) holds the column to one contract on\nboth backends; test_unit_store.gd's battle compares every unit's\nbearing on both engines every tick. Also adds the two .uid files step\n2a left out.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 142\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KJir8iR53McBd6htaR6zKM",
